                                "sense_id": "70b0d83a-c6cd-386c-a4c3-d85ce5aa2d0a",
                                "text": "\"I don't know, Teri asked me if I was a featherwood and I said no because I don't have wings […]\" […] \"Girl do you know what a featherwood is?\" Tai asked. \"I thought it was a bird.\" \"God you're so innocent.\" Dolores stated."
                            },
